      "text": " Oh God, I hope so."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:13.000",
      "start": "00:01:09.000",
      "text": " A great many people see you as heroes."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:16.000",
      "start": "00:01:13.000",
      "text": " His name was Charlie Spencer."
    },
    {
