      "text": " He murdered him."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:25.000",
      "start": "00:01:22.000",
      "text": " I'm trying to save as many people as we can."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:28.000",
      "start": "00:01:25.000",
      "text": " Sometimes it doesn't mean everybody."
