      "text": " Take that off, what aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:39.000",
      "start": "00:01:35.000",
      "text": " You know, you may not be a thing, but you better self-tending to be a hero."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:42.000",
      "start": "00:01:39.000",
      "text": " A hero? Like you finish it."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:44.000",
      "start": "00:01:42.000",
      "text": " He's my friend."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:48.000",
      "start": "00:01:45.000",
      "text": " He gives them with you to the end of the line."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:50.000",
      "start": "00:01:48.000",
      "text": " So was I."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:56.000",
      "start": "00:01:52.000",
      "text": " Every time someone tries to win a war before it starts in a simple manner."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:58.000",
      "start": "00:01:57.000",
      "text": " Every time."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:00.000",
      "start": "00:01:58.000",
      "text": " This isn't gonna change what happened."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:03.000",
      "start": "00:02:02.000",
      "text": " I..."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:05.000",
      "start": "00:02:03.000",
      "text": " He killed me."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:08.000",
      "start": "00:02:06.000",
      "text": " And I'm the man who killed the Avengers."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:10.000",
      "start": "00:02:08.000",
      "text": " I'm dead myself."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:13.000",
      "start": "00:02:11.000",
      "text": " I'm dead."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:22.000",
      "start": "00:02:20.000",
      "text": " Wasn't nightmare was my legacy."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:25.000",
      "start": "00:02:22.000",
      "text": " At the end of the path I started us on."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:27.000",
      "start": "00:02:25.000",
      "text": " Watch my friends die."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:28.000",
      "start": "00:02:27.000",
      "text": " I don't feel so good."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:30.000",
      "start": "00:02:28.000",
      "text": " You'd think that'd be as bad as it gets, right?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:32.000",
      "start": "00:02:30.000",
      "text": " Please, I don't want to go."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:34.000",
      "start": "00:02:32.000",
      "text": " I don't want to go."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:37.000",
      "start": "00:02:35.000",
      "text": " Nope."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:40.000",
      "start": "00:02:38.000",
      "text": " Wasn't the worst part."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:43.000",
      "start": "00:02:40.000",
      "text": " The worst part is that you didn't."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:49.000",
      "start": "00:02:46.000",
      "text": " There's been so long."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:53.000",
      "start": "00:02:51.000",
      "text": " So long."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:56.000",
      "start": "00:02:53.000",
      "text": " Well, I couldn't leave my best girl."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:58.000",
      "start": "00:02:56.000",
      "text": " Now it's yours me a dance."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:01.000",
      "start": "00:02:58.000",
      "text": " And I have to protect the one thing that I can't live without."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:03.000",
      "start": "00:03:01.000",
      "text": " That's you."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:06.000",
      "start": "00:03:04.000",
      "text": " It's only you."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:09.000",
      "start": "00:03:06.000",
      "text": " For as long as I can remember, I just wanted to do what was right."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:13.000",
      "start": "00:03:11.000",
      "text": " Guess I'm not quite sure what that is anymore."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:15.000",
      "start": "00:03:13.000",
      "text": " The world has changed."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:18.000",
      "start": "00:03:16.000",
      "text": " None of us can cope right."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:21.000",
      "start": "00:03:19.000",
      "text": " All we can do is our best."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:25.000",
      "start": "00:03:21.000",
      "text": " And sometimes the best that we can do is to start over."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:27.000",
      "start": "00:03:25.000",
      "text": " Last night, I dreamt."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:29.000",
      "start": "00:03:27.000",
      "text": " We had a kid."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:31.000",
      "start": "00:03:29.000",
      "text": " It was so real."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:33.000",
      "start": "00:03:31.000",
      "text": " I want you to be proud of him."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:36.000",
      "start": "00:03:33.000",
      "text": " How are we guys planning on beating that?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:39.000",
      "start": "00:03:38.000",
      "text": " Together."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:41.000",
      "start": "00:03:39.000",
      "text": " We'll lose."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:44.000",
      "start": "00:03:41.000",
      "text": " And we'll do that together too."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:46.000",
      "start": "00:03:44.000",
      "text": " Ben and I were doing research."
    },
